00:02:07.584 --> 00:02:09.067
(laughter)

00:02:09.067 --> 00:02:10.173
It depends.

00:02:11.130 --> 00:02:12.151
True for me too.

00:02:12.151 --> 00:02:14.550
So no, but I love this about your son.

00:02:14.550 --> 00:02:16.980
'Cause this is my dream that
one of my children will cook.

00:02:16.980 --> 00:02:17.922
'Cause I don't like cooking.

00:02:17.922 --> 00:02:20.220
And your son cooks really well as a chef.

00:02:20.220 --> 00:02:21.240
- It's amazing.

00:02:21.240 --> 00:02:22.560
He's so good at it.

00:02:22.560 --> 00:02:24.600
You know, he saved us during the pandemic

00:02:24.600 --> 00:02:26.850
