00:02:37.813 --> 00:02:41.310
And I think he learned
even more than what he knew

00:02:41.310 --> 00:02:44.670
because he even started doing,
like, sushi, Lebanese food.

00:02:44.670 --> 00:02:46.710
And I'm like, what?

00:02:46.710 --> 00:02:48.750
He taught himself how to do it.

00:02:48.750 --> 00:02:49.825
It's amazing, yeah.

00:02:49.825 --> 00:02:51.900
- What's, like, your proudest moment?

00:02:51.900 --> 00:02:54.150
