00:02:58.444 --> 00:02:59.277
- Yes.

00:02:59.277 --> 00:03:00.210
- [Kelly] And you've been a single mom.

00:03:00.210 --> 00:03:01.043
- Yes.

00:03:01.043 --> 00:03:01.876
