00:03:01.876 --> 00:03:03.990
'Cause it's hard to be
there for everything,

00:03:03.990 --> 00:03:05.160
to hold down a job.

00:03:05.160 --> 00:03:06.330
- It's super hard.

00:03:06.330 --> 00:03:08.250
And, you know, when you're
young, I was very young,

00:03:08.250 --> 00:03:09.930
and for example, now that I'm 51,

00:03:09.930 --> 00:03:11.310
I think we talked about it a little bit

00:03:11.310 --> 00:03:13.463
when we were, the last
time that I saw you.

00:03:13.463 --> 00:03:14.296
- Yeah.

00:03:14.296 --> 00:03:15.990
- It's like, you know, we
should have done things

00:03:15.990 --> 00:03:17.730
a little bit, you know, different,

00:03:17.730 --> 00:03:20.010
because I didn't know, I was young,

00:03:20.010 --> 00:03:22.440
I was 20 years old when I had Manolo,

00:03:22.440 --> 00:03:24.870
so I was kind of raising
myself at the same time.

00:03:24.870 --> 00:03:25.950
So what, I mean -
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:03:25.950 --> 00:03:27.720
- I should have been going to therapy

00:03:27.720 --> 00:03:30.450
or somebody should have been guiding me.

00:03:30.450 --> 00:03:32.670
But I am so proud that
he turned out amazing

00:03:32.670 --> 00:03:34.110
and super hard-working.

00:03:34.110 --> 00:03:34.943
- Yeah.

00:03:34.943 --> 00:03:38.100
- And that he, you know, that
he wants to do things in life

00:03:38.100 --> 00:03:39.840
and he's excited about life.

00:03:39.840 --> 00:03:42.820
I think that's what all
mothers, you know, wish for.

00:03:42.820 --> 00:03:44.310
- Yeah, yeah.

00:03:44.310 --> 00:03:45.960
And just polite and respectful.

00:03:45.960 --> 00:03:46.793
- [Sofia] Yes, very.

00:03:46.793 --> 00:03:47.910
- That's my thing, I'm like, if anything,

00:03:47.910 --> 00:03:49.954
you can be any of the things,
but just kind would be good.

00:03:49.954 --> 00:03:52.108
- Kind, yeah, be kind to other people.

00:03:52.108 --> 00:03:56.163
I mean, I don't have anything
bad to say about my son.

00:03:57.180 --> 00:03:58.320
So I did a great job.

00:03:58.320 --> 00:03:59.763
- Ha, I love it!

00:04:00.630 --> 00:04:01.463
