00:04:53.962 --> 00:04:56.220
Because at least I was in my 20s.

00:04:56.220 --> 00:04:58.700
I was like 23 when he told me that!

00:04:58.700 --> 00:05:00.030
(laughter)

00:05:00.030 --> 00:05:02.730
- You're like, I should
be killing it right now.

00:05:02.730 --> 00:05:04.800
No wait, they're honest kids.

00:05:04.800 --> 00:05:05.633
I love it.

00:05:05.633 --> 00:05:07.290
There's also this one, though,

00:05:07.290 --> 00:05:10.519
