- That's Colombia.

00:05:13.550 --> 00:05:15.780
I was at the beach,
that's my cousin, Joji,

00:05:15.780 --> 00:05:17.820
and we're just at the, you know,

00:05:17.820 --> 00:05:19.863
the local beach in Colombia.

00:05:19.863 --> 00:05:21.630
- Yeah!
- And I had Manolo there.

00:05:21.630 --> 00:05:22.650
- I love it!

