00:05:37.417 --> 00:05:39.252
- Oh, I've seen other, yeah.

00:05:39.252 --> 00:05:40.415
(Sofia laughs)
Yeah, that's more chill.

00:05:40.415 --> 00:05:43.680
That's like, the calm before the storm.

00:05:43.680 --> 00:05:44.959
- Yeah, exactly.

00:05:44.959 --> 00:05:46.463
- It's incredible.

00:05:46.463 --> 00:05:48.510
I want to get into a couple parts.

00:05:48.510 --> 00:05:50.220
But before we do, like, kind of explain

00:05:50.220 --> 00:05:51.069
the series to everybody.
- [Sofia] Yes.

00:05:51.069 --> 00:05:53.961
Well, it's a very interesting character

00:05:53.961 --> 00:05:57.000
because it was a real woman that existed.

00:05:57.000 --> 00:05:57.833
- Yeah.

00:05:57.833 --> 00:06:00.090
- In the 70s and in the 80s in Colombia.

00:06:00.090 --> 00:06:03.390
She became one of the
biggest drug lords in,

00:06:03.390 --> 00:06:05.820
you know, in this business.

00:06:05.820 --> 00:06:06.653
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:06:06.653 --> 00:06:08.070
- And, you know, it's not like now,

00:06:08.070 --> 00:06:12.180
now women can do things like
that, be to the level of men,

00:06:12.180 --> 00:06:14.527
but in that era it was really rare.

00:06:14.527 --> 00:06:15.360
- [Kelly] Unheard of.

00:06:15.360 --> 00:06:16.380
- [Sofia] Yes, it was unheard.

00:06:16.380 --> 00:06:19.646
And there has been, in history,
women that have been able

00:06:19.646 --> 00:06:21.810
to do a little bit of that business,

00:06:21.810 --> 00:06:24.000
but not to the level that she got to.

00:06:24.000 --> 00:06:26.100
And she got away with it for so long

00:06:26.100 --> 00:06:29.730
because nobody was suspecting
that it was a woman.

00:06:29.730 --> 00:06:30.563
- Yeah.

00:06:30.563 --> 00:06:34.910
- So there, it was like,
I mean, paralyzing to me

00:06:35.753 --> 00:06:39.180
because, to understand that
this woman really existed

00:06:39.180 --> 00:06:41.321
while she was raising four kids.

00:06:41.321 --> 00:06:42.360
- Yeah.

00:06:42.360 --> 00:06:44.910
- And I'm like, why didn't
I ever heard of her?

00:06:44.910 --> 00:06:48.862
I live in Colombia in that
era, the 70s, the 80s, the 90s.

00:06:48.862 --> 00:06:52.350
My brother was, unfortunately,
part of that business.

00:06:52.350 --> 00:06:53.460
He got killed in Colombia.

00:06:53.460 --> 00:06:58.292
And I know that character so well,

00:06:58.292 --> 00:07:02.311
how did none of us knew about
her, about her existence?

00:07:02.311 --> 00:07:04.350
And I started digging in, digging in,

00:07:04.350 --> 00:07:05.940
and there's a lot on her.

00:07:05.940 --> 00:07:06.773
- Yeah.

00:07:06.773 --> 00:07:09.690
- There's public records,
she was in jail for 22 years,

00:07:09.690 --> 00:07:11.310
I mean, it was a whole disaster.

00:07:11.310 --> 00:07:13.320
- Wow, I think that's,
isn't that kind of, they say

00:07:13.320 --> 00:07:15.600
a true boss is the one that
you don't even know exists?

00:07:15.600 --> 00:07:16.433
- Yeah.
- Like, you know

00:07:16.433 --> 00:07:17.266
what I'm saying?
- Yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:07:17.266 --> 00:07:18.099
- Like a true boss is one
that doesn't even have to,

00:07:18.099 --> 00:07:18.932
like, say it?

00:07:18.932 --> 00:07:19.765
- Exactly.

00:07:19.765 --> 00:07:20.598
- Yeah.

00:07:20.598 --> 00:07:23.820
- It was a very difficult
story for me to understand

00:07:23.820 --> 00:07:25.380
because it's a woman.

00:07:25.380 --> 00:07:26.460
- Yeah, I'm like, how do you connect

00:07:26.460 --> 00:07:27.879
with that character,
too, that's a drug lord?

00:07:27.879 --> 00:07:31.140
- Yes, you know, I feel
like women always are,

00:07:31.140 --> 00:07:34.207
we're protecting, like,
you know, surviving.

00:07:34.207 --> 00:07:37.050
But I did understand her
because I was a woman,

00:07:37.050 --> 00:07:39.540
I was Colombian, I was a
single mother like her.

00:07:39.540 --> 00:07:43.668
I mean, she escaped
abuse when she was young.

00:07:43.668 --> 00:07:46.601
I haven't, but, I mean, there
was a lot of similarities

00:07:46.601 --> 00:07:50.010
and I've raised a kid on my own,

00:07:50.010 --> 00:07:51.720
I'm an immigrant, she was an immigrant.

00:07:51.720 --> 00:07:52.948
So there were a lot of similarities.

00:07:52.948 --> 00:07:57.480
The thing is that she went, I want to say,

00:07:57.480 --> 00:08:02.190
like she lost her mind and
did things in that business

00:08:02.190 --> 00:08:04.020
that were, like, ruthless.

00:08:04.020 --> 00:08:04.853
- Yeah.

00:08:04.853 --> 00:08:09.853
- And she ended, not in a good way.

00:08:10.290 --> 00:08:12.720
- Yeah, I love that tease, I love it.

00:08:12.720 --> 00:08:14.579
So I, this is incredible.

00:08:14.579 --> 00:08:17.610
(stammers)
I feel like

00:08:17.610 --> 00:08:19.920
they only changed your nose or something.

00:08:19.920 --> 00:08:20.753
- What?!

00:08:20.753 --> 00:08:21.586
- I don't know what they did.

00:08:21.586 --> 00:08:23.160
(laughter)
- Are you crazy?

00:08:23.160 --> 00:08:25.080
- No I'm saying, like,
whatever they did, though,

00:08:25.080 --> 00:08:26.040
it looked slight.

00:08:26.040 --> 00:08:27.360
It doesn't look like,
you know what I'm saying?

00:08:27.360 --> 00:08:28.260
Like when you look at you -

00:08:28.260 --> 00:08:30.611
- No Kelly, it was hours.

00:08:30.611 --> 00:08:31.922
- Here's what I'm saying.

00:08:31.922 --> 00:08:32.850
(laughter)
No, here's what I'm saying.

00:08:32.850 --> 00:08:34.200
It probably took time -

00:08:34.200 --> 00:08:35.220
- Don't be jealous!

00:08:35.220 --> 00:08:39.026
- The slight change
completely changed your being.

00:08:39.026 --> 00:08:40.890
- It was a wig!

00:08:40.890 --> 00:08:42.023
Shut up.
- Shut up?

00:08:42.023 --> 00:08:44.615
